@Order.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### Succeeds: total price (2 x 25 = 50) is <= 100, so the payment step completes
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/create-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 1,
  "orderItems": [
    { "productId": 21, "count": 2, "price": 25 }
  ]
}

### Fails at payment: total price (3 x 50 = 150) is > 100, stock is rolled back
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/create-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 1,
  "orderItems": [
    { "productId": 22, "count": 3, "price": 50 }
  ]
}

### Fails at stock: product 24 only has 10 units seeded
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/create-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 1,
  "orderItems": [
    { "productId": 24, "count": 50, "price": 1 }
  ]
}
